        "translation": "O Allah, by You we enter the morning and by You we enter the evening"
      },
      "m5": {
        "arabic": "يَا حَيُّ يَا قَيُّومُ بِرَحْمَتِكَ أَسْتَغِيثُ",
        "transliteration": "Ya Hayyu Ya Qayyumu birahmatika astagheeth",
